A"},{"bioguideId":"P000597","fullName":"Rep. Pingree, Chellie [D-ME-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-11-19","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"ME"},{"bioguideId":"G000553","fullName":"Rep. Green, Al [D-TX-9]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-12-02","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TX"},{"bioguideId":"H001094","fullName":"Rep. Hoyle, Val T. [D-OR-4]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-12-02","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OR"},{"bioguideId":"M001238","fullName":"Rep. McBride, Sarah [D-DE-At Large]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-12-09","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"DE"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-17T15:32:45+00:00","id":"hjres126-119","introducedDate":"2025-09-19","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-09-19","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Foreign Affairs."},"laws":[],"number":"126","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"International Affairs","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"C001121","district":6,"fullName":"Rep. Crow, Jason [D-CO-6]","party":"D","state":"CO"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-09-19","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p>This joint resolution directs the President to remove U.S. Armed Forces from hostilities against any organization designated on or after February 20, 2025,&nbsp;as a foreign terrorist organization or specially designated global terrorist, any states in which such entities operate, or any non-state organization engaged in illegal drug trafficking unless a declaration of war or authorization to use military force for such purpose has been enacted.</p><p>The resolution specifies that it shall not be construed to prevent the United States from defending itself from an armed attack&nbsp;or the threat of an imminent armed attack or from using the U.S. Armed Forces in support of civil authorities as part of authorized counternarcotics operations.</p>","updateDate":"2026-07-14T20:45:51Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"A joint resolution to direct the removal of United States Armed Forces from hostilities that have not been authorized by Congress.","type":"hjres","updateDate":"2026-07-14T20:46:01Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-14T20:46:01Z"}
